description: CSS rules for Bootstrap 5 with custom styles.
globs: ["resources/css/**/*.css", "resources/sass/**/*.scss", "public/**/*.css"]
alwaysApply: true

- Prefer Bootstrap components/utilities; extend via small custom classes.
- Avoid inline styles; keep CSS in files processed by Vite.
- Keep selectors specific but not overly global; avoid !important unless justified.
- Enforce responsive/mobile-first patterns.
- Keep files modular; split large styles by feature or page.
